From: Maxim Stepanov <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 02:05:45 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] agent_ui: generalize render_subagent_card behind
 SubagentSource
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Pure data-source refactor — native subagent rendering is unchanged in
output, just reads through SubagentSnapshot instead of inline
Entity<ThreadView> access. Sets up the qwen same-thread card (next
task) to reuse this exact function instead of a separate, hand-styled
implementation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
